WEBVTT

00:01:25.998 --> 00:01:30.294
Now, my own work shows
that the global experts confused

00:01:30.294 --> 00:01:34.215
the difference between preparedness
and vulnerability.

00:01:34.757 --> 00:01:37.135
These two are not the same thing.

00:01:37.885 --> 00:01:40.471
To avoid this predicted fate,

00:01:40.471 --> 00:01:43.891
Africa followed the global stampede
into wholesale lockdown.

00:01:44.475 --> 00:01:48.771
Ironically, the global trend has been
for the more developed countries,

00:01:48.771 --> 00:01:50.731
such as the US and the UK,

00:01:50.731 --> 00:01:53.151
to often be more hard-hit by the pandemic.

00:01:53.901 --> 00:01:57.822
Of course the fact that Africa
did not suffer the predicted burden

00:01:57.822 --> 00:01:59.323
is good news for the continent.